str.val:
%:	zero or more characters;
_:	any single character;
[]:	single character within the specified range ([a-f]) or ([abcdef]);
[^]:	single character not within the specified range ([^a-f]) or ([^abcdef])

When Quick Record is enabled, the record wizard will not be shown. When start quick recording:
1. The file name and directory will be auto generated according to "File Name Options" and "Directory Options";
2. The bitrate is equal to the default bitrate (calculated based on video width, height, and frame rate) multiplied by the bitrate scaling percentage used for the last recording;
3. The others (such as the codec, time-lapse, etc) will be the same with the last used.
